  <revision rev="4" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>becc56424b586ec6a0247025c278bd15</srcmd5>
    <version>3.2.0</version>
    <time>1748364566</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Forwarded request #1279815 from tinita

- updated to 3.2.0 (3.002)
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-Mojo-DOM58/Changes
  3.002     2025-05-19 19:29:08 EDT
    - Added EXPERIMENTAL support for :text pseudo-class. (from Mojolicious 9.14)
    - Fixed Mojo::DOM58 not to auto-close tags in &lt;svg&gt; and &lt;math&gt; blocks.
      (from Mojolicious 9.21)
    - Fixed multiple &quot;&lt;script&gt;&quot; parsing issues. (from Mojolicious 9.31)
    - Fixed a bug where strings like &quot;&lt;.&gt;&quot; were considered valid tags.
      (from Mojolicious 9.31)
    - Fixed various CSS selector equation bugs. (from Mojolicious 9.32)</comment>
    <requestid>1279827</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="5" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>b0f303a461a3d7b6006bfbe1b62dbd9f</srcmd5>
    <version>3.3.0</version>
    <time>1793990068</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- updated to 3.3.0 (3.003)
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-Mojo-DOM58/Changes
  3.003     2026-10-24 23:26:07 EDT
    - Fix whitespace handling in descendent combinator (from Mojolicious 9.44)
    - Handle script tags spec compliant (from Mojolicious 9.44)
    - Fix various comment parsing issues (from Mojolicious 9.44)
    - Fix parsing of tag opener (from Mojolicious 9.44)
    - Replace recursive CSS matcher with iterative approach (from Mojolicious 9.44)
    - Fix spec compliance issue with attribute selectors (from Mojolicious 9.46)
    - Fix security issue where the content of title and textarea elements was not
      escaped during rendering, allowing escaped end tags to break out and turn
      sanitized HTML into live markup (from Mojolicious 9.50)
    - Fix bug where CDATA sections, processing instructions, and DOCTYPE declarations
      did not end at the first &quot;&gt;&quot; in HTML documents (from Mojolicious 9.51)
    - Fix bug where the content of &quot;&lt;style&gt;&quot; and &quot;&lt;script&gt;&quot; elements in &quot;&lt;svg&gt;&quot; and
      &quot;&lt;math&gt;&quot; blocks was not parsed as markup (from Mojolicious 9.51)
    - Fix bug where end tags like &quot;&lt;/style/&gt;&quot; did not end &quot;&lt;style&gt;&quot; and &quot;&lt;script&gt;&quot;
      elements (from Mojolicious 9.51)
    - Fix bug where raw text moved out of &quot;&lt;style&gt;&quot; and &quot;&lt;script&gt;&quot; elements, for
      example with strip, was not escaped (from Mojolicious 9.51)
    - Fix bug where any processing instruction containing &quot;xml&quot; would activate XML
      mode (from Mojolicious 9.51)
    - Replace invalid codepoints with replacement character and map the C1 control
      range to windows-1252 in html_unescape, as required by the WHATWG HTML
      standard (from Mojolicious 9.52)
    - Improve at performance for selectors without combinators (from Mojolicious 9.53)
    - Improve HTML/XML parsing performance matching attributes only once
      (from Mojolicious 9.53)
    - Fix bug where many unclosed comments, CDATA sections, processing instructions
      or RCDATA elements could make parsing extremely slow (from Mojolicious 9.53)</comment>
    <requestid>1395143</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
